odo-take/1.1
name: Seaboard RISE: opening
by: ROLI, "Seaboard RISE x SWAM & Camelot Pro" (YouTube 11Qprwtzl6s), performed by Heen-Wah Wai; written for odo by Claude
about: A short excerpt of ROLI's demo, to learn from: ROLI, "Seaboard RISE x SWAM & Camelot Pro" (YouTube 11Qprwtzl6s), performed by Heen-Wah Wai, 0:00.0 to 0:17.0,
about: played on a Seaboard with the same three-zone split as what follows (SWAM Cello | SWAM Clarinet | SWAM Oboe; not named on screen here). Music and performance theirs (all rights reserved).
about: Transcribed for odo by machine (Basic Pitch) with each note's own pitch curve (bends, scoops,
about: vibrato) and loudness (pressure) measured from the recording, in free time (one beat a second).
about: On the Hex (Wicki-Hayden, chromatic): left keyboard: cello; right keyboard: clarinet. Bends played as on the Hex: two fingers in the key, slid out of it.
about: A test of how close a touch screen gets to the Seaboard: listen against the video.
